\ calls.fth - the libraries' words against simulated memory (gate E4). The
\ register writes were checked against the RP2350 datasheet and Pico SDK.
.( core ) CR $10001 UNRESET DEPTH . CR
.( timer ) CR TIMER0.INIT 3 MS 0 MS 50 US DEPTH . CR
.( gpio-out 25 ) CR 25 GPIO.OUT DEPTH . CR
.( pullup 15 ) CR 15 GPIO.IN-PULLUP 15 GPIO.READ . DEPTH . CR
.( drive ) CR 25 GPIO.12MA GPIO.DRIVE DEPTH . CR
.( high toggle ) CR 25 GPIO.HIGH 25 GPIO.TOGGLE DEPTH . CR
.( od 4 ) CR 4 GPIO.OD 4 GPIO.OD-LOW 4 GPIO.OD-RELEASE DEPTH . CR
.( irq 28 ) CR 28 GPIO.FALL 28 GPIO.RISE 3 GPIO.BOTH DEPTH . CR
.( irq clear ) CR 28 GPIO.IRQ-CLEAR 28 GPIO.EDGE-LOW GPIO.IRQ-OFF DEPTH . CR
.( adc ) CR ADC.INIT 26 ADC.PIN 0 ADC.READ . 2048 ADC.MV . DEPTH . CR
.( pwm calc ) CR 1000 PWM.CALC . . 20 PWM.CALC . . 1000000 PWM.CALC . . CR
.( pwm 25 1k 40 ) CR PWM.RESET 25 1000 40 PWM.START DEPTH . CR
.( duty 75 ) CR 25 75 PWM.DUTY DEPTH . CR
.( freq 500 ) CR 25 500 PWM.FREQ DEPTH . CR
.( pc 2 ) CR 2 1000 50 PWM.START-PC DEPTH . CR
.( pair ) CR 0 1 20000 50 PWM.PAIR DEPTH . CR
.( slices ) CR 0 PWM.SLICE . 17 PWM.SLICE . 25 PWM.SLICE . 33 PWM.SLICE . CR
.( watchdog ) CR 8000 WATCHDOG.START WATCHDOG.KICK WATCHDOG.STOP DEPTH . CR
.( powman ) CR 28 POWMAN.WAKE-FALL POWMAN.WAKE 8 POWMAN.REQUEST DEPTH . CR
.( alarm ) CR ' DEPTH 1 TIMER0.HANDLER! 250000 1 TIMER0.ALARM-EVERY DEPTH . CR
.( alarm t1 ) CR 1000 2 TIMER1.ALARM-IN 2 TIMER1.ALARM-OFF DEPTH . CR
.( spi init ) CR 1000000 SPI0.INIT . DEPTH . CR
.( spi1 baud ) CR 10000 SPI1.BAUD . CR
.( spi pins ) CR 18 19 16 SPI0.PINS 17 SPI0.CS DEPTH . CR
.( spi wrong pin ) CR 19 18 16 SPI0.PINS
DEPTH . CR
.( pulldown, E9 ) CR 14 GPIO.IN-PULLDOWN 14 GPIO.READ . DEPTH . CR
.( spi xfer ) CR SPI0.SELECT $9F SPI0.XFER . SPI0.RECV . SPI0.DESELECT DEPTH . CR
.( i2c init ) CR 100000 I2C0.INIT . DEPTH . CR
.( i2c pins ) CR 4 5 I2C0.PINS DEPTH . CR
.( i2c reg! ) CR 0 $6B $68 I2C0.REG! . DEPTH . CR
.( i2c reg@ ) CR $75 $68 I2C0.REG@ . DEPTH . CR
.( i2c nack ) CR -1 NACK ! $75 $68 I2C0.REG@ . I2C0.ERROR @ . 0 NACK ! DEPTH . CR
.( uart init ) CR 9600 UART1.INIT . DEPTH . CR
.( uart pins ) CR 4 5 UART1.PINS DEPTH . CR
.( uart fmt ) CR 7 2 1 UART1.FORMAT DEPTH . CR
.( uart loop ) CR $41 UART1.EMIT UART1.KEY? . UART1.KEY . DEPTH . CR
.( trng ) CR TRNG.INIT 1 TRNG.MIX U. DEPTH . CR
.( trng random ) CR TRNG.RANDOM DROP DEPTH . CR
.( ram ) CR VARIABLE V 5 V +! V @ . CR
.( uart ring ) CR UART1.BUFFER $41 URX-PUT $42 URX-PUT UART1.KEY? . UART1.KEY . UART1.KEY . UART1.KEY? . CR
UART1.UNBUFFER DEPTH . CR
.( i2c nested ) CR : NEST $75 $68 I2C1.REG@ DROP ; ' NEST HOOK !
CREATE B4 4 ALLOT  B4 4 $50 I2C0.WRITE . I2C0.ERROR @ . DEPTH . CR
.( refused ) CR
9600 UART0.INIT
5 4 UART1.PINS
2 SPI0.SEND-NOT-A-WORD
1 0 1000 50 PWM.PAIR
